00:44:37.440 --> 00:44:39.570
that you can use now
and hopefully later.

00:44:39.570 --> 00:44:42.810
And we hope we've left you
with visions of awesome course

00:44:42.810 --> 00:44:44.760
websites that you can
make in the future,

00:44:44.760 --> 00:44:46.160
dancing in your head.

00:44:46.160 --> 00:44:50.160
So we're happy to take
