files than GIFs,

00:46:43.740 --> 00:46:46.960
and it won't weigh
down your site as much.

00:46:46.960 --> 00:46:50.220
And then you can just embed
those into any R Markdown

00:46:50.220 --> 00:46:52.870
file using a video tag.

